WEBVTT

00:27:29.880 --> 00:27:32.602
that they're grasping,
and we're trying to find a balance.

00:27:32.626 --> 00:27:35.212
My problem is, today,
with the social justice warriors,

00:27:35.236 --> 00:27:37.920
is the assumption that life
is primarily about conflict,

00:27:37.944 --> 00:27:41.093
that there's a class conflict,
there's a racial conflict,

00:27:41.117 --> 00:27:43.213
and that there tends
to be hard differences.

00:27:43.237 --> 00:27:46.127
If you listen to Bernie Sanders
or Elizabeth Warren,

00:27:46.151 --> 00:27:48.482
they tend to describe in conflict terms.

00:27:48.506 --> 00:27:51.730
There's the system of bankers,
the us-versus-them,

00:27:51.754 --> 00:27:53.307
the rich-versus-the-people.

00:27:53.331 --> 00:27:54.919
CA: Oppression.
DB. Oppression.

00:27:54.943 --> 00:27:56.484
And I fundamentally think

00:27:56.508 --> 00:27:59.241
there's a lot more stupidity
than oppression in the world,

00:27:59.265 --> 00:28:01.863
and a lot of our problems
are just caused by stupidity.